# ── docs/ policy (2026-09-30): docs/ is a normal tracked directory EXCEPT for
#    the explicitly ignored subpaths below (generated binaries / render output).
#    A new contributor creating docs/<name>.md should NOT need a gitignore
#    exception — plain `git add docs/whatever.md` works.
docs/*
!docs/*.md
!docs/research/
docs/research/*
!docs/research/*.md
!docs/research/*.csv
!docs/research/*.json
# legacy noesis PDF/LaTeX build artifacts (regenerable)
docs/*.pdf
docs/*:Zone.Identifier
docs/stage3_environment.json
# keep prior behavior: package-level docs dirs stay ignored
rhan_core/docs/
# RHAN_NXA/docs is the Gen-1 documentation deliverable — tracked, unlike legacy docs folders; it lives INSIDE the noesis_vision package as of 2026-09-24
!noesis_vision/RHAN_NXA/docs/
